<title>UK: South West Water ahead after broker upgrade.</title>
<headline>South West Water ahead after broker upgrade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in South West Water bucked a weaker UK market on Wednesday after NatWest Securities upgraded its recommendation on the stock to &quot;add&quot; from &quot;hold&quot;, market sources said.</p>
<p>South West Water was trading 26p higher at 706p by late morning.</p>
<p>NatWest analysts were not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8712</p>
